{"w":"the","s":289.76,"e":290.04,"line":100},{"w":"question,","s":290.04,"e":290.6,"line":100},{"w":"your","s":290.86,"e":291.3,"line":100},{"w":"soul","s":291.3,"e":291.42,"line":100},{"w":"answered","s":291.42,"e":292.02,"line":100},{"w":"free,","s":292.02,"e":292.84,"line":100},{"w":"Love","s":293,"e":293.68,"line":101},{"w":"haxed","s":293.68,"e":293.96,"line":101},{"w":"the","s":293.96,"e":294.4,"line":101},{"w":"stars","s":294.4,"e":294.74,"line":101},{"w":"through","s":294.74,"e":295.96,"line":101},{"w":"the","s":295.96,"e":296.58,"line":101},{"w":"psychic","s":296.58,"e":296.88,"line":101},{"w":"machine.”","s":296.88,"e":297.7,"line":101}],"lines":[{"s":29.98,"e":32.94,"text":"**“Quarter in the Psychic Machine”**"},{"s":36.34,"e":38.46,"text":"Drop a quarter in the psychic machine,"},{"s":38.92,"e":41.5,"text":"By the tarot-card table in velvet and green,"},{"s":41.56,"e":45.32,"text":"Stars spark, hearts start, love leaks through the screen,"},{"s":46.3,"e":49.24,"text":"Moonlight moves like a mystic machine."},{"s":49.78,"e":51.84,"text":"I asked one question, the glass eyes gleamed,"},{"s":51.84,"e":53.82,"text":"The brass bell rang and the bright lights beamed,"},{"s":53.82,"e":55.96,"text":"Leet hax in the zodiac, fate in the code,"},{"s":55.96,"e":58.2,"text":"Then my mind took flight down a moon-mapped road."},{"s":58.2,"e":60.76,"text":"Pages are sparks, fresh starts, first art from the soul,"},{"s":60.76,"e":62.42,"text":"Knights are the chase, the race, the road,"},{"s":62.42,"e":64.38,"text":"Queens are the knowing, the glowing inside,"},{"s":64.38,"e":66.82,"text":"Kings are command, calm crowns, mastered tides."},{"s":66.82,"e":70.58,"text":"Then I zoned out, rolled out, soul spun around,"},{"s":70.6,"e":74.3,"text":"Fell through the stars without touching the ground,"},{"s":74.22,"e":78.52,"text":"Love got loud, fate got found, time broke down,"},{"s":78.52,"e":82.6,"text":"And the court cards crowned me in a dream-drift town."},{"s":82.6,"e":85.12,"text":"Cups are the heart, the art, the ache, the affection,"},{"s":86.6,"e":89.36,"text":"Wands are the fire, desire, divine direction,"},{"s":90.74,"e":93.5,"text":"Swords are the thought, the truth, the sharp selection,"},{"s":94.86,"e":97.32,"text":"Coins are the work, the worth, the world’s reflection."},{"s":99.22,"e":101.2,"text":"Page of Cups came soft as rain,"},{"s":101.2,"e":103.3,"text":"New love, true love, dew on the vein,"},{"s":103.3,"e":105.3,"text":"Dreaming and feeling, revealing what’s real,"},{"s":105.3,"e":107.42,"text":"A tender little message from the heart you heal."},{"s":107.42,"e":109.46,"text":"Knight of Cups rode with a rose and a rhyme,"},{"s":109.46,"e":111.6,"text":"Charm in his arms, moon-music in time,"},{"s":111.6,"e":113.52,"text":"Romance in motion, devotion in flight,"},{"s":113.52,"e":115.7,"text":"But fast stars fade when they burn too bright."},{"s":115.7,"e":117.76,"text":"Queen of Cups in a silver sea,"},{"s":117.76,"e":119.78,"text":"Psychic and soft, she could see through me,"},{"s":119.86,"e":121.8,"text":"Mercy in motion, emotion in bloom,"},{"s":121.8,"e":123.98,"text":"She haxed my heart by the light of the moon."},{"s":123.96,"e":126.08,"text":"King of Cups kept calm in the crash,"},{"s":126.08,"e":128.16,"text":"Storms may roar, but he never acts rash,"},{"s":128.16,"e":130.22,"text":"Master of feeling, healing the tide,"},{"s":130.22,"e":132.54,"text":"Love stays strong when the soul can guide."},{"s":132.54,"e":134.26,"text":"Page of Wands had a wild flame grin,"},{"s":134.26,"e":136.32,"text":"Bright new beginnings burning within,"},{"s":136.32,"e":138.24,"text":"Spark in the dark, art in the air,"},{"s":138.24,"e":141.9,"text":"Saying, “Start that dream if you dare, if you dare.”"},{"s":142.56,"e":144.62,"text":"Knight of Wands came bold, fast, loud,"},{"s":144.62,"e":146.74,"text":"Thunder in his tires, fire in his cloud,"},{"s":146.74,"e":148.64,"text":"Passion and action, attraction and speed,"},{"s":148.64,"e":150.88,"text":"A pickup-truck comet with a rocket-fueled need."},{"s":150.88,"e":152.94,"text":"Queen of Wands wore a sunlit stare,"},{"s":153.3,"e":154.96,"text":"Black-cat magic in her midnight hair,"},{"s":155.02,"e":157.1,"text":"Confidence, courage, charm in her chest,"},{"s":157.1,"e":159.12,"text":"Love like lightning made the stars confess."},{"s":159.12,"e":161.14,"text":"King of Wands held a vision so wide,"},{"s":161.14,"e":163.28,"text":"Fire in his fist and the future inside,"},{"s":163.28,"e":165.16,"text":"Leader and dreamer, commander of flame,"},{"s":165.16,"e":167.22,"text":"He made one spark into a kingdom of fame."},{"s":167.22,"e":169.4,"text":"The machine said, “Listen, the lesson is coded,"},{"s":169.4,"e":171.38,"text":"Stars are the script and your heart is loaded,"},{"s":171.38,"e":173.66,"text":"Love is the password, spirit is the map,"},{"s":173.66,"e":177.22,"text":"Fate is a firewall the brave can hax.”"},{"s":177.58,"e":179.78,"text":"Page of Swords had a curious crown,"},{"s":179.78,"e":181.9,"text":"Sharp little spark where the truth comes down,"},{"s":181.9,"e":183.88,"text":"Questions and messages, whispers and wires,"},{"s":183.88,"e":186.04,"text":"A mind like a blade with electric desires."},{"s":186.04,"e":188.12,"text":"Knight of Swords flew swift through the storm,"},{"s":188.12,"e":190.2,"text":"Fast with the facts and fierce in form,"},{"s":190.2,"e":192.02,"text":"Truth in his teeth, lightning in flight,"},{"s":192.02,"e":194.32,"text":"But speed needs wisdom or it misses what’s right."},{"s":194.32,"e":196.38,"text":"Queen of Swords had a boundary blade,"},{"s":196.38,"e":198.48,"text":"Clear cold calm from the scars she made,"},{"s":198.48,"e":200.42,"text":"Honest and healed, she could cut through lies,"},{"s":200.42,"e":202.58,"text":"A sorrow-born star with diamond eyes."},{"s":202.58,"e":204.48,"text":"King of Swords ruled reason and right,"},{"s":204.48,"e":206.7,"text":"Law like lightning, logic like light,"},{"s":206.7,"e":208.64,"text":"Clean command, clear crown, cosmic sight,"},{"s":208.64,"e":210.86,"text":"He haxed the chaos and restored the night."},{"s":210.86,"e":212.78,"text":"Page of Coins held a golden seed,"},{"s":212.78,"e":214.7,"text":"Study and skill, plan and proceed,"},{"s":214.7,"e":216.84,"text":"New work, new worth, earth-born spell,"},{"s":217,"e":219.04,"text":"A star-rooted dream learning how to dwell."},{"s":219.04,"e":220.94,"text":"Knight of Coins moved steady and slow,"},{"s":221,"e":223.08,"text":"Patient and loyal, making roots grow,"},{"s":223.1,"e":224.7,"text":"Grit over glitter, labor over luck,"},{"s":224.62,"e":227.22,"text":"Leet hax in the habit when the hard road’s stuck."},{"s":227.22,"e":229.42,"text":"Queen of Coins had a hearth-fire glow,"},{"s":229.42,"e":231.5,"text":"Comfort and care where the good things grow,"},{"s":231.5,"e":233.52,"text":"Love made practical, peaceful, and known,"},{"s":233.52,"e":235.62,"text":"A garden of stars around a generous home."},{"s":235.62,"e":237.7,"text":"King of Coins wore a harvest crown,"},{"s":237.7,"e":239.76,"text":"Built from the dirt, not a hand-me-down,"},{"s":239.76,"e":241.54,"text":"Stable and able, secure on his throne,"},{"s":241.54,"e":246,"text":"He made love last by building it stone by stone."},{"s":246,"e":246.947,"text":"Final Chorus"},{"s":247.42,"e":252.64,"text":"Then I zoned out, rolled out, soul spun around,"},{"s":252.64,"e":256.34,"text":"Fell through the stars without touching the ground,"},{"s":256.26,"e":260.6,"text":"Love got loud, fate got found, time broke down,"},{"s":260.6,"e":264.72,"text":"And the court cards crowned me in a dream-drift town."},{"s":264.72,"e":268.3,"text":"Pages are sparks, Knights are motion,"},{"s":269.13,"e":273.3,"text":"Queens are the magic, deep as an ocean,"},{"s":273.22,"e":277.06,"text":"Kings are mastery, steady and proud,"},{"s":277.92,"e":281.18,"text":"Stars sang love through a tarot-card cloud."},{"s":281.18,"e":283.78,"text":"The reader smiled, said, “Now you see,"},{"s":284.52,"e":287.96,"text":"The cards were a mirror, the code was the key,"},{"s":288.56,"e":292.84,"text":"Your heart asked the question, your soul answered free,"},{"s":293,"e":297.7,"text":"Love haxed the stars through the psychic machine.”"}],"duration":309.16,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-29T02:49:44.451Z","stats":{"whisperWords":810,"polishedWords":778,"matched":673,"matchRate":0.865}}